<title>CHINA: China Oct retail sales up 12.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Oct retail sales up 12.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's retail sales reached 214.8 billion yuan ($25.9 billion) in October, up an inflation-adjusted 12.7 percent over the same month last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>It did not give a figure for the January-October period.</p>
<p>Sales of consumer goods such as motorcylces, airconditioners and washing machines were relatively strong, it said. Restaurant receipts also showed sharp growth.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
